---
// returns.astro - WNCPARTSLINGERS Return & Refund Policy
import '../styles/global.css';
---

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Return & Refund Policy | WNCPARTSLINGERS</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Return windows, refund procedures, and condition requirements for WNCPARTSLINGERS vintage automotive components." />
    <meta name="p:domain_verify" content="84b06eac7f89764d1148798575c74a4a" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/css/all.min.css" />
</head>
<body>

    <!-- Header & Navigation -->
    <header class="navbar">
        <a href="/" class="logo">
            <span class="highlight">WNC</span>PARTSLINGERS
        </a>
        <nav>
            <ul class="nav-links">
                <li><a href="/">Home</a></li>
                <li><a href="/#catalog">Inventory Catalog</a></li>
                <li><a href="/shipping">Shipping</a></li>
                <li><a href="/returns" class="active">Returns</a></li>
                <li><a href="/contact">Contact</a></li>
                <li><a href="https://www.ebay.com/str/wncpartslingers" target="_blank" rel="noopener">eBay Store</a></li>
            </ul>
        </nav>
        <div class="nav-actions">
            <a href="https://www.ebay.com/str/wncpartslingers" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn-primary">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-store"></i> eBay Storefront
            </a>
        </div>
    </header>

    <main class="pdp-container" style="max-width: 850px; padding: 40px 20px;">
        <span class="tagline">// GUARANTEE & RETURNS</span>
        <h1 style="font-size: 2.5rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 8px;">Return & Refund Policy</h1>
        <p style="color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 32px;">30-Day Money-Back Guarantee on Verified Automotive Components</p>

        <div class="pdp-specs-box" style="margin-bottom: 24px;">
            <h2 style="font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 12px; color: var(--text-main);">1. 30-Day Return Window</h2>
            <p style="color: var(--text-muted);">We stand behind the authenticity and description of every part we catalog. We offer a <strong>30-day return policy</strong> from the date of carrier delivery confirmation on all eligible items.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="pdp-specs-box" style="margin-bottom: 24px;">
            <h2 style="font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 12px; color: var(--text-main);">2. Item Condition Requirements</h2>
            <p style="color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 8px;">Due to the collectible, unrepeatable nature of New Old Stock (NOS) parts, returned items must satisfy the following conditions:</p>
            <ul style="color: var(--text-muted); margin-left: 24px; margin-bottom: 12px; line-height: 1.8;">
                <li>Item must be <strong>uninstalled, unaltered, and unmounted</strong> with no signs of installation damage, grease, or thread stripping.</li>
                <li>Must include original factory packaging, manufacturer blister packs, header cards, and all included hardware/accessories as originally shipped.</li>
                <li>Items sold as "Factory Sealed" must remain sealed to receive a full refund.</li>
            </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="pdp-specs-box" style="margin-bottom: 24px;">
            <h2 style="font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 12px; color: var(--text-main);">3. Return Shipping & Restocking Fees</h2>
            <p style="color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 8px;">
                <strong>Standard Returns:</strong> If an item was purchased by mistake or is no longer needed, the buyer is responsible for return shipping costs. We charge <strong>zero restocking fees</strong>.
            </p>
            <p style="color: var(--text-muted);">
                <strong>Damaged or Incorrect Items:</strong> In the rare event that an item arrives damaged in transit or does not match our catalog description, we provide a prepaid return shipping label and cover all return costs.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="pdp-specs-box" style="margin-bottom: 24px;">
            <h2 style="font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 12px; color: var(--text-main);">4. Refund Processing</h2>
            <p style="color: var(--text-muted);">Once the returned part is received and inspected at our Hendersonville warehouse, your refund is issued within <strong>2 business days</strong> back to the original method of payment through eBay's secure platform.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="pdp-specs-box" style="margin-bottom: 24px;">
            <h2 style="font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 12px; color: var(--text-main);">5. How to Initiate a Return</h2>
            <p style="color: var(--text-muted);">To start a return, navigate to your order in your eBay account purchase history and select "Return Item", or email our support desk at <a href="mailto:parts@wncpartslingers.com" style="color: var(--accent-neon);">parts@wncpartslingers.com</a> with your order number.</p>
        </div>
    </main>

    <!-- Footer -->
    <footer>
        <p>&copy; 2026 WNCPARTSLINGERS. Built for automotive restorers and performance technicians. · <a href="/shipping">Shipping Policy</a> · <a href="/returns">Return Policy</a> · <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a> · <a href="/contact">Contact Us</a> · <a href="https://www.ebay.com/str/wncpartslingers" target="_blank" rel="noopener">eBay Store</a></p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
